    "A": "$x^{6}+3x^{5}-12x^{3}+36$",
    "B": "$x^{6}+\\frac{3}{2}x^{5}+\\frac{9}{4}x^{4}-12x^{3}-18x^{2}+36$",
    "C": "$x^{6}+3x^{5}+\\frac{9}{4}x^{4}-12x^{3}-18x^{2}+36$",
    "D": "$x^{6}+3x^{5}+\\frac{9}{4}x^{4}-12x^{3}-9x^{2}+36$"
